{"id": "EUVD-2026-108512", "enisaUuid": "8a75af7a-300e-3068-9bbc-3366ea6d8a96", "description": "tarfile.tar_filter could be bypassed using crafted link entries, including symlinks with empty or directory-like names, to redirect later archive members outside the intended extraction directory. This allowed a malicious tar archive to cause tarfile.extractall() with filter=\"tar\" to write files outside the destination directory, subject to the permissions of the extracting process.\n\nThis is the tarfile.tar_filter counterpart of CVE-2026-7774, which covered tarfile.data_filter.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T20:57:36", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-23T00:36:58", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/160098", "https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/160097", "https://mail.python.org/archives/list/security-announce@python.org/thread/43JOWPRAV5DI3VZ4FUEUAZOHCATXXOCK/", "https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/0901ad4ffb22605f12b705d1c1197f0a01f0ba0b", "https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/c6ada40177436e4e2533a7b252082b5f0c043477", "https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/e7e0b3523ad6ba8472873dda594cf4021a16f8b5"], "aliases": ["GHSA-mw29-5qxh-rr87", "CVE-2026-114583"], "assigner": "PSF", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "723291da-62b6-304c-9be9-5c67d24adb43", "product": {"name": "CPython", "vendor": {"name": "Python Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "0 <3.16.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "caa17b2e-0b0e-3f36-8b4d-cdf253682ccf", "vendor": {"name": "Python Software Foundation"}}], "isExploited": false}